Kind: widen
Issue: #598
Holds open: the window between a detach's question "was that the function's last?" and its clearing of the enable -- a spin, so that the other processor's attach can land inside it on demand

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/cpu/device_machdep.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/cpu/device_machdep.c
index 746ddcb2..369988d8 100644
--- a/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/cpu/device_machdep.c
+++ b/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/cpu/device_machdep.c
@@ -832,6 +832,8 @@ msi_detach(unsigned int slot, struct pci_msix *gone)
 				break;
 			}
 
+		for (volatile unsigned int w = 0; w < 100000u; w++)
+			cpu_pause();
 		if (last)
 			pci_msix_disable(gone);
 	}
